For her first problem, right knee pain, I have diagnosed her with chondromalacia patella. She will take anti-inflammatories, ibuprofen 600 mg 4 times a day with food. I recommended that she perform straight leg raising exercises to strengthen her quadriceps. We will re-evaluate in 2 weeks if her symptoms do not improve.

